  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-427-459">夕方に雨が降り出した</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-459-488">小供は家へ走りこむ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-488-523">ポストは家へはいれない</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-523-532">雷ごろ</seg><choice source="#source-532-538"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-538-555">なり出して</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-555-573">ポストはシク</seg><choice source="#source-573-579"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-579-596">泣いて居る</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-596-625">今まで町で遊んでた</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-625-660">四つ辻かどに立って居る</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-660-695">そのまゝ其所で立ずくみ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-695-710">いな妻ピカ</seg><choice source="#source-710-716"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-716-733">　光り出す</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-733-787" style="padding-inline-end: 0em; text-align: right">
        <p><seg source="#source-751-787">（大正十一年二月七日綴）</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
